        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lung rianramei rui ata gumliam the,",
            "Theimei chang duang gut khang;",
            "Lummei rui theimei ta ngam lou the,",
            "Kanloumeipu rui kao guang.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Neila the ntau mu ai ruina,",
            "Poubaumei njangmei jianthaimeipu;",
            "Abumang ta kanpat lou the.",
            "",
            "2. Laujiu nah bam pui bam guangtang pukhou,",
            "Neilana ariuni;",
            "Theimei Jordan dui kanpat pukhou,",
            "Tingkau khumki khou bamni.",
            "",
            "3. Neilamei lungning gaimei naimei hei,",
            "Jisu rui ti tuange;",
            "Kandih neilamei khang suang gai e,",
            "Tingkau neilamei 5#^ mu."
          ]
        }
      },
